tinyelements is independently implemented from published conic geometry.
Vallado's Python coe2rv, rv2coe, rv2rsw, rv2ntw, and rv2pqw at commit
49df0479c950917c0a2c5ac31f2db6477bba57f6 were executed only as comparison oracles.
No AGPL source was translated or included. Raw oracle output and its generator
remain ignored in .validation/tinyelements/. Numerical expected outputs are
frozen in tests/data/reference.h; no upstream runtime dependency is required.
Source: https://github.com/CelesTrak/fundamentals-of-astrodynamics/tree/49df0479c950917c0a2c5ac31f2db6477bba57f6
